---
/* L81 - the same three answers, and what the state costs when it travels three times. */
---

<figure class="fig">
  <div class="fig__frame">
    <img
      class="fig__picture"
      src={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}illustrations/L81.jpg`}
      alt="A line drawing of two roller conveyor tracks: the upper one carries a sheet of paper with a small folded note, and the lower one carries a larger sheet with two small slips beside it."
    />
    <svg
      class="fig__svg"
      viewBox="0 0 640 340"
      role="img"
      aria-labelledby="L81-fig-title L81-fig-desc"
    >
      <title id="L81-fig-title">One call costs 161 tokens, three calls cost 216</title>
      <desc id="L81-fig-desc">
        Two horizontal token bars for one ticket. The upper bar, labelled one call
        with three questions, is 161 tokens long: a dark block of 28 tokens for the
        state, then a prussian block of 133 tokens for the questions. The lower bar,
        three calls with one question each, is 216 tokens long: three separate dark
        blocks of 28 tokens, one for each trip, then the same 133 tokens of
        questions. A bracket between the two right-hand ends marks a saving of 55
        tokens, about 25 per cent.
      </desc>

      <!-- legend -->
      <rect x="30" y="30" width="14" height="10" fill="var(--color-ink)" />
      <text x="50" y="39" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="10" fill="var(--color-ink-70)">the state, sent again on every call</text>
      <rect x="330" y="30" width="14" height="10" fill="var(--color-prussian)" />
      <text x="350" y="39" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="10" fill="var(--color-ink-70)">the three questions, sent once either way</text>

      <!-- bar A: one call -->
      <text x="60" y="80" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="11" fill="var(--color-ink-70)">one call, three questions</text>
      <rect x="60" y="92" width="53" height="22" fill="var(--color-ink)" />
      <rect x="113" y="92" width="253" height="22" fill="var(--color-prussian)" />
      <text x="376" y="107" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="11" fill="var(--color-ink)">161 tokens</text>

      <!-- bar B: three calls -->
      <text x="60" y="150" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="11" fill="var(--color-ink-70)">three calls, one question each</text>
      <g class="m-rise" style="--m-rise: 10px; --m-duration: 0.6s; --m-delay: 0.2s;">
        <rect x="60" y="162" width="53" height="22" fill="var(--color-ink)" />
      </g>
      <g class="m-rise" style="--m-rise: 10px; --m-duration: 0.6s; --m-delay: 0.45s;">
        <rect x="113" y="162" width="53" height="22" fill="var(--color-ink)" />
      </g>
      <g class="m-rise" style="--m-rise: 10px; --m-duration: 0.6s; --m-delay: 0.7s;">
        <rect x="166" y="162" width="54" height="22" fill="var(--color-ink)" />
      </g>
      <rect x="220" y="162" width="253" height="22" fill="var(--color-prussian)" />
      <text x="483" y="177" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="11" fill="var(--color-ink)">216 tokens</text>

      <!-- the saving -->
      <path d="M 366 196 V 206 H 473 V 196" fill="none" stroke="var(--color-ink-45)" stroke-width="1" />
      <text x="419" y="224" text-anchor="middle" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="11" fill="var(--color-ink-70)">55 tokens saved, about 25%</text>

      <!-- the numbers underneath -->
      <rect x="30" y="242" width="580" height="72" fill="var(--color-ground-deep)" stroke="var(--color-rule)" stroke-width="1" />
      <text x="44" y="266" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="11" fill="var(--color-ink-70)">routing-001: state 28 tokens, the three questions 133 tokens</text>
      <text x="44" y="288" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="11" fill="var(--color-ink-70)">cost_usd = tokens x price_per_mtok / 1,000,000</text>
      <text x="44" y="306" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="11" fill="var(--color-ink-70)">10,000 tickets of 500 tokens = 5 Mtok = $0.19 at $0.038/Mtok</text>

      <text x="30" y="332" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="10" fill="var(--color-ink-45)">the same three answers: the state is the expensive part, and it is the part you send again for free</text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption class="fig__caption">
    <span class="edge-code">figure L81</span>
    <span class="fig__caption-text">Batching three questions into one call sends the 28-token state once instead of three times, and 216 tokens become 161.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  /* scoped to this figure */
  .fig__svg {
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }
</style>
